#: ../../source/index.md:3 51217948828f490cb1895d34b8c5108b
msgid ""
"Welcome to the documentation for **FiveAges Sim** — a multi-repository ROS 2"
" robotics ecosystem for control, simulation, and deployment developed by "
"[FiveAges](https://github.com/fiveages-sim)."
msgstr ""
"欢迎阅读 **FiveAges Sim** 文档 — 这是由 [FiveAges](https://github.com/fiveages-sim) "
"开发的多仓库 ROS 2 机器人生态系统，覆盖控制、仿真与部署。"

#: ../../source/index.md:8 e5c24e3da3604274a98e716bc5bfbb42
msgid ""
"New here? Start with the [Learning Path](0-overview/2-learning_path.md) to "
"understand the stack, then follow [Quick Demo (Public "
"Path)](1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md) to get a robot moving in "
"simulation within minutes."
msgstr ""
"第一次来？请先阅读[学习路径](0-overview/2-learning_path.md)以了解技术栈，然后按照[快速演示（公开路径）](1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md)操作，几分钟内即可在仿真中让机器人动起来。"

#: ../../source/index.md:11 0db652fba869443ba4e6f286f5cca0d6
msgid "About This Ecosystem"
msgstr "关于本生态系统"

#: ../../source/index.md:13 26b9af0e90bb47c983d48f16f291fd98
msgid "FiveAges Sim provides:"
msgstr "FiveAges Sim 提供："

#: ../../source/index.md:15 9249cbb0e466416e9396f7183697cc2a
msgid ""
"**Unified robot descriptions** — URDF/xacro packages for wheeled-arm "
"humanoids, manipulators, and mobile robots"
msgstr "**统一的机器人描述** — 覆盖轮臂人形、机械臂和移动机器人的 URDF/xacro 软件包"

#: ../../source/index.md:16 f34fdfb43de0453f9eb7309a771f99a3
msgid ""
"**Hardware interfaces** — ROS 2 control plugins for various robot platforms "
"(Dobot, ARX, Galbot, HT, and more)"
msgstr "**硬件接口** — 适用于多种机器人平台（Dobot、ARX、Galbot、HT 等）的 ROS 2 control 插件"

#: ../../source/index.md:17 4913af9293d5430f83a2f60c22f8e5b2
msgid "**MPC controllers** — OCS2-based arm and whole-body controllers"
msgstr "**MPC 控制器** — 基于 OCS2 的机械臂与全身控制器"

#: ../../source/index.md:18 d73c262adab341fab5cfa51030756bbd
msgid ""
"**Simulation backends** — Gazebo Harmonic and NVIDIA Isaac Sim integration"
msgstr "**仿真后端** — 集成 Gazebo Harmonic 与 NVIDIA Isaac Sim"

#: ../../source/index.md:19 c401eb78da414b028224080ce74b8133
msgid ""
"**Teleop solutions** — VR, isomorphic teleop, DexCap, and glove-based "
"teleoperation"
msgstr "**遥操作方案** — VR、同构遥操作、DexCap 以及基于手套的遥操作"

#: ../../source/index.md:20 69dd37bc12c144f390b9babe4812d8dc
msgid ""
"**Python libraries** — High-level interfaces for robot control and data "
"collection"
msgstr "**Python 库** — 用于机器人控制与数据采集的高层接口"

